<title>UK: London precious metals close up except palladium.</title>
<headline>London precious metals close up except palladium.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $352.80/$353.30, up 40 cents. Little changed all day despite bearish tone ahead of Comex option expiry Friday. Volume light.</p>
<p>SILVER - Finished up three cents at $5.27/$5.29.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Closed 60 cents up at $382.00/$383.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ended at $151.75/$152.75, down $3.75. Off low. Wary after Almaz confirmed exporting soon.</p>
</text>
